IMAPAccount mail
{{- if eq .profile "personal" }}
Host imap.fastmail.com
PassCmd "secret-tool lookup app_id mbsync"
{{- end }}
{{- if eq .profile "work" }}
Host imap.gmail.com
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
PassCmd "{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.local/bin/mutt_oauth2.py ~/.{{ .email }}.tokens"
{{- end }}
Port 993
User {{ .email }}
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /opt/homebrew/etc/ca-certificates/cert.pem

IMAPStore mail-remote
Account mail

MaildirStore mail-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/
Inbox ~/Mail/INBOX

Channel mail
Far :mail-remote:
Near :mail-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
